/ActualText (Experience\nJalasoft | Backend Developer \(Dec 2023 - Aug 2026\)\nAdded compatibility for New Outlook desktop alongside Outlook classic in a client integration tool\nDiagnosed and fixed Android app issues around incorrect data output and offline connectivity\nRefactored a core MRP feature and proposed solution improvements\nFixed layout/overlap bugs in a PDF/print reporting module\nBuilt and maintained an integration test suite, adding coverage to existing features and setting up the process for new ones\nUsed Claude Code and Cursor for code generation, bug diagnosis, and test writing \204 increasing ticket throughput\nBuilt custom AI agents and skills to handle recurring workflow tasks, and tuned context/token usage for cost efficiency\nTook ownership of onboarding and training new developers, including AI-assisted workflows\nIntroduced version control for internal client documentation\n\nJalasoft | Fullstack \(Sep 2023 - Dec 2023\)\nIntegrated facial-detection library to calculate attendance percentage from webcam feed\nAdded role-based validation to API endpoints\nResolved UI bugs across the client application)
