/ActualText (Experience\nBanco BCP | Fullstack \(Feb 2023 - Sep 2023\)\nSupport for React and .NET applications\nCI/CD with Azure DevOps\nMaintenance of legacy projects\nImplementation of AWS Lambda functions\nJWT authentication\nSystem documentation\nAPI documentation with Swagger\n\nBanco BCP | Cuentas Premium\nMigration from .NET Framework to .NET 6\nUsage of Basic Auth and JWT authentication\nDocument generator and template updates\nSeparation of concerns between layers\nAPI documentation with Swagger and Postman\n\nJalasoft | Backend \(Internship\) \(Oct 2022 - Feb 2023\)\nShadowed a development team on a warehouse simulation and debugging tool, working on one module under a mentor who assigned code review tasks.\nFocused on backend and business logic of a microservices module deployed with Docker containers.\nIdentified design patterns in the module and applied them in a refactoring.\nFundacion Jala | Scholar \(May 2022 - Sep 2022\)\nCompleted an intensive training program \(cohort of 18 students\) in C# backend development, JavaScript frontend and DevOps.\nPracticed through coding exercises, mock interviews and team mini-projects, plus sessions with a manager on remote work.\nBuilt a final team project: an applicant tracking system.\n)
