/ActualText (Software engineer with 3+ years of experience in .NET/C# and SQL Server, building production systems for ERP, banking and real-time communication platforms. I refactor core features safely and build integration tests that keep them stable. I use Claude Code and Cursor daily, build custom agents and skills for recurring team tasks, and focus on AI-powered backends with React/TypeScript on the front. I enjoy mentoring: I've onboarded new developers and run technical interviews.)
